<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-28T08:12:30.398Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:12:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to assault communities in Plateau State, killing dozens and abducting residents, while bandits seized nine people in Zamfara. Armed men killed 13 Niger soldiers in Sanam, and separate attacks left multiple injured in Plateau and Kaduna. Governors in Plateau and Niger states have ordered stronger security measures and condemned the violence. The conflict remains severe, with 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQaW1hZmN4Z2pRcGg1LXlFQ3J4NjRqZFVINWJHX2FWUjF5TTNGT3RkRFRnVDhabVc2TDd6UGw5S1poYjhJakxzMGxxaDNWQW9FV2J6WjdfOVVkTVRjRlVGbVExYnV5VjVIYnBRX3B3d2kxTG1IOXZaRFNSTDN6WXd3d2JWUVFVaWMweDRJQkpzQWVhZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQeTdlS1I0TDMzclk0V0ZuTC1sWGpMNHdmSWVVcmhvUDZ1WnBIcnVldjlydExvQzVtUlNpb2IxVXVSMndLajFBZnF5Q00xOTF2TFc5MUhuc1JLZjI3NEpXeHUwRmllM2tZei1lYU9tc1JHektUNGlUS3ZlTkQ5Q0VnWV9NNzFtaG42dXJYTXY3SHB3OUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE5jNjhMVVRVZEpuTERNNmpQWFNBcXlGcXhVTktneGRUandzQUlDRndicVVmWDZObzUzWlpiZC1LTjZGSzRPRlU2SkR4bEp3dGdNUHhRQktPLUpGQ2Nac0M5Vk5PcG5HeDRT?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOWk1jbmNMelBsbXpXcV9lSkVuZmRPNXpRMzhDdUs0VVZlYjlFWXAtMmVDajd2QVNJY3VKN05qZzNaWjRINnNDWkwwc0tDQzZFMTFGWEQyVlFjVkxNanNnZ240WGhhSlAtM0VWTFZfaGp1Y2xPTnA2LV9SWDZfZWs4Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE1pQ3h1d3d3czF2dEVBNFNPZUFhUEVpSEgwV1l3UTJ1T1FwNE5sOHMxeUUzUExUTC0zYjQ0eU5TQTBYd3dYNnFvMmhKa2xYbTQ4QUxMN